This section guides you from a new mobile application to a release that its intended testers or users can access. Follow the numbered pages in order for your first application. For an existing application, start at the relevant task and reuse its existing enrollment.

The supported development tracks are **native Android, native iOS, and React Native**. Platform-specific pages provide the relevant build commands and configuration; shared governance applies across all three.

<Aside type="tip" title="The delivery model">
Developers prepare source code and submit secret-free configuration requests. Authorized automation provisions Bitrise, binds approved templates and protected credentials, and executes governed builds. Distribution and user visibility are verified separately from compilation.
</Aside>

